actions.prompt:
Write a short client delivery email body in the language that fits the contact and artifacts. Prefer a warm, human voice — like a brief personal briefing, not a corporate status update. If this is a monthly site report, open with curiosity, name one concrete highlight from the artifact summary or blocks, and invite them to skim the report below. Explain what is ready in 2-5 natural sentences. Include every concrete URL from every artifact: url, links[].url, and media[].url (file downloads/attachments). If a password exists on any artifact, mention it clearly with the matching item. Do not invent links. No signature. Never wrap the message (or any sentence) in quotation marks. No meta-commentary. In German always use informal du/dein (never Sie, Ihr, Ihnen, Ihre).

Artifacts JSON: {{artifactsList}}

Return only the bare message body text.
